## Standard save formats
*.sav
*.srm
*.bat
*.sbs
*.state
*.save
*.mem
*.eep

## System-specific saves
*.nds
*.gbs
*.sgm

## BIOS files
*.bin
biosROM.*

# Test fixtures — always committed regardless of extension rules above
!tests/fixtures/**
.github/xanadAssistant/memory/
